WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:04.410
OK, real quick voicemail about vaccination.

00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:05.700
Take a listen to this.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:06.700
Yeah.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:13.139
Hey, David, Stan and Marina Valley really
liked your show, but I have a question if,

00:00:13.139 --> 00:00:21.220
if and when the core virus vaccine becomes
available, will you be raising your hand to

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:24.290
be first in line to get the vaccine?

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:30.140
The reason I ask is because I noticed your
team be very critical of anti batters.

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:36.040
Well, yeah, and it's not that I'm anti batter
or anything like that, but I think I'm not

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:39.370
nearly as confident as you are about the use
of them.

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:40.970
So I appreciate a.

00:00:40.970 --> 00:00:43.579
An answer on that.

00:00:43.579 --> 00:00:48.070
The answer is, I will absolutely be at the
front of the line now.

00:00:48.070 --> 00:00:52.210
I won't be allowed at the front of the line
in the sense that the vaccine, after being

00:00:52.210 --> 00:00:57.010
tested on thousands and thousands of people
in each each vaccine will be tested on many,

00:00:57.010 --> 00:01:01.899
many people in the first few million doses
are going to go to health care workers.

00:01:01.899 --> 00:01:05.720
The next ones are going to go to health care
workers and the most vulnerable population.

00:01:05.720 --> 00:01:10.280
So even if I wanted to be first in line for
the vaccine, once it had been properly tested,

00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:11.939
I'm not going to be first in line.

00:01:11.939 --> 00:01:12.939
Right.

00:01:12.939 --> 00:01:17.060
Because as someone in my thirties without
preexisting conditions, there is not a priority

00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:18.670
to get me the vaccine.

00:01:18.670 --> 00:01:20.510
Health care workers and vulnerable people.

00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:24.710
But, yes, I will be there looking to get a
corona virus vaccine.

